No .claude/launch.json found. Create C:\Users\edmem\OneDrive\Desktop\Nxeon\singapore\.claude\launch.json with this format:
{
  "version": "0.0.1",
  "configurations": [
    {
      "name": "<unique-name>",
      "runtimeExecutable": "<command>",
      "runtimeArgs": ["<args>"],
      "port": <port>
    }
  ]
}
